.TH "CSSTRANSFORMCOMPONENT" "3JS" "August 11, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSTransformComponent \- CSSTransformComponent
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]CSSTransformComponent\f[B]\f[R] interface of the CSS
Typed Object Model API is part of the \f[CR]CSSTransformValue\f[R]
interface.
.SH INSTANCE PROPERTIES
.TP
\f[B]CSSTransformComponent.is2D\f[R]
A boolean that represents whether the transform is 2D or 3D.
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
.TP
\f[B]CSSTransformComponent.toMatrix()\f[R]
Returns a new \f[CR]DOMMatrix\f[R] object.
.TP
\f[B]CSSTransformComponent.toString()\f[R]
A string in the form of a CSS transform function.
.RS
.PP
This will use the value of \f[CR]is2D\f[R] to return either a 2D or 3D
transform.
For example if the component represents \f[CR]CSSRotate\f[R] and
\f[CR]is2D\f[R] is false then the string returned will be in the form of
the CSS transformation \f[CR]rotate3d()\f[R] function.
If true the string returned will be in the form of the 2\-dimensional
\f[CR]rotate()\f[R] function.
.RE
.SH INTERFACES BASED ON CSSTRANSFORMCOMPONENT
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]CSSTranslate\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
